            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Benaiah the son of Jehoiada was a valiant man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the son of a valiant man",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Kabzeel, a doer of great deeds; he smote two ariels",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The meaning of the word",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ariel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Moab. He also went down and slew a lion in a pit on a day when snow had fallen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he slew an Egyptian, a man of great stature, five cubits tall. The Egyptian had in his hand a spear like a weaver's beam; but Benaiah went down to him with a staff, and snatched the spear out of the Egyptian's hand, and slew him with his own spear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things did Benaiah the son of Jehoiada, and won a name beside the three mighty men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was renowned among the thirty, but he did not attain to the three. And David set him over his bodyguard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
